"Before initial use the ID for each servo needs to be set using the DYNAMIXEL"
" Wizard configuration tool."
msgstr "首次使用前，需要使用DYNAMIXEL Wizard配置工具为每个舵机设置ID。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-servo-robotis.rst:30
#: 5add8fce287548aead10a7575dd8a06b 82f995bb2e77448c8862baea525825e8
#: aac1f45ee7e04e399fb5f2976dcf0126 b9840bc42ce14ee1bf67651c4e0d7d4f
#: c7c43394ffaf4a42ab16be09c139298e
msgid ""
"`DYNAMIXEL Wizard 2.0 "
"<http://emanual.robotis.com/docs/en/software/dynamixel/dynamixel_wizard2/>`__"
" is the latest DYNAMIXEL configuration tool supporting Windows / Linux / Mac"
" OSX."
msgstr ""
"`DYNAMIXEL Wizard 2.0 "
"<http://emanual.robotis.com/docs/en/software/dynamixel/dynamixel_wizard2/>`__"
" 是最新的DYNAMIXEL配置工具，支持Windows/Linux/Mac OSX。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-servo-robotis.rst:32
#: 474d6b48c5e84fd3a165be3731a3e639 6dff07d218e34c5483503bef7cfe15a9
